1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,067
Welcome to Hacienda de LuisAna, known as Munting Mansyon ng Luisiana,
 
2
00:00:05,067 --> 00:00:08,300
a private countryside estate in Luisiana, Laguna.
 
3
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:11,533
This repository powers its complete digital ecosystem,
 
4
00:00:11,533 --> 00:00:15,667
uniting guest bookings, estate operations, and smart-lock access control.
 
5
00:00:15,667 --> 00:00:19,333
Built around a strict two-role architecture, the system separates concerns
 
6
00:00:19,333 --> 00:00:20,800
into two purpose-built applications.
 
7
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:25,233
Guests browse and book exclusively on the React and Vite web application,
 
8
00:00:25,233 --> 00:00:31,133
while the Admin runs operations from a dedicated Flutter Android app, backed by one Firebase project.
 
9
00:00:31,133 --> 00:00:33,233
The estate offers three canonical accommodations:
 
10
00:00:33,233 --> 00:00:37,067
the private Main House for families and groups, the HDL Annex,
 
11
00:00:37,067 --> 00:00:38,800
and two A-House camping units.
 
12
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:45,033
Nightly weekday, weekend, and holiday schedules are published live by the Admin and stamped onto every booking quote.
 
13
00:00:45,033 --> 00:00:48,567
On the Guest website, visitors check a privacy-safe availability calendar
 
14
00:00:48,567 --> 00:00:50,667
that enforces a thirty-day lead time.
 
15
00:00:50,667 --> 00:00:55,600
Guests receive a server-attested quote, upload their fifty-percent downpayment receipt via GCash or BDO,
 
16
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:59,100
and submit their booking to claim a twenty-four-hour date hold.
 
17
00:00:59,100 --> 00:01:03,633
Inside the Flutter Admin app, the operator manages the full booking lifecycle.
 
18
00:01:03,633 --> 00:01:06,667
Using on-device receipt OCR and transactional date re-checks,
 
19
00:01:06,667 --> 00:01:09,700
the Admin verifies payment proofs and approves bookings,
 
20
00:01:09,700 --> 00:01:14,200
advancing stays from Pending and Approved to Checked-In, Staying, Checked-Out, and Completed.
 
21
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:18,233
Physical access at the estate is controlled by an ESP32 smart-lock gateway.
 
22
00:01:18,233 --> 00:01:21,933
Guests unlock their assigned unit using either a physical RFID card
 
23
00:01:21,933 --> 00:01:23,633
or an in-app Mobile Key.
 
24
00:01:23,633 --> 00:01:29,700
The first valid unlock on check-in day automatically marks the booking Checked-In and records an append-only access log.
 
25
00:01:29,700 --> 00:01:32,333
Security is enforced at every layer.
 
26
00:01:32,333 --> 00:01:36,300
Sensitive Admin actions require a six-digit PBKDF2 Security PIN,
 
27
00:01:36,300 --> 00:01:40,700
while Firestore rules enforce financial invariants and append-only audit logs.
 
28
00:01:40,700 --> 00:01:45,967
Guests also enjoy real-time chat with the Admin and verified post-stay reviews.
 
29
00:01:45,967 --> 00:01:48,300
Backed by twenty-four Architecture Decision Records
 
30
00:01:48,300 --> 00:01:51,433
and comprehensive web, mobile, and security-rule test suites,
 
31
00:01:51,433 --> 00:01:56,500
Hacienda de LuisAna delivers a resilient, modern hospitality platform from booking to checkout.
 